Litmus includes code derived from Muter.

    https://github.com/muter-mutation-testing/muter
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Muter

The mutation operators, the schemata rewriter and the report formatters are
adapted from that project. The execution layer is not: Muter drives its test
runs by rewriting the .xctestrun property list for every mutant, while Litmus
passes the mutant switch through the documented TEST_RUNNER_<VAR> interface of
xcodebuild and leaves the .xctestrun untouched.

A full copy of the Muter license is kept in LICENSES/muter-MIT.txt.
